Subject: Cantor Provider-Free Portable Release Bundle P0 Smoke Faults

@ [fault_uuid] 583dab87-b52a-46fc-8546-9d6767c2e28f

& [Recognition]
  + the first smoke run stopped before artifact creation because culture-aware Sort-Object did not equal the intended ordinal sequence around uppercase BUNDLE_README
  + ISO-shaped timestamp evidence was automatically converted to DateTime by PowerShell JSON decoding
  + ZIP DOS metadata retained exact clock fields but reconstructed a local offset because the format carries no timezone
  + the first checked run refused because the governed experiment parent had not yet been created
  + the explicit-replacement test exposed File.Replace null backup-path overload coercion as an empty-path fault

& [Containment]
  + no provider network dependency policy secret configuration service process archive extraction executable execution or foreign workspace file was touched
  + failed staging paths were removed only after exact temporary-root identity and non-reparse validation

& [Resolution]
  + archive order is the exact closed six-path sequence rather than culture sorting
  + timestamp evidence uses a non-date contract token and verifier checks timezone-free ZIP DOS clock fields
  + the owned experiment parent was explicitly created before the checked run
  + same-volume File.Move with overwrite replaces the two exact files without ambiguous backup-path input
  + checked generation verification cross-generation equality explicit replacement three producer refusals and fifteen verifier refusals pass
